{"asset_key":"mn/quest_story_11211260","episode":"mn","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11211260","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1121126001:1":{"text":"将軍、一通り聞き込みしてきたぜ。新しい情報も手に入った。","source_cn":"将军，我们又走访调查了一圈，发现了些新情报。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE89517DBB3675A7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1121126002:1":{"text":"いいところに来たな、女神像が見つかったそうだ。","source_cn":"你们来得正好，女神像找到了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x58ADF5E28C37FDC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1121126003:1":{"text":"え！？見つかった？何処で？","source_cn":"什么，找到了？在哪里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD31DF2B26D799F75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1121126004:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">太陽の神殿</style>だ。ここにいる聖堂の方たちが知らせに来てくれたのだ。","source_cn":"<style=highlight>就在日神殿</sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B1DAD92AAAD1450","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1121126005:1":{"text":"だが、見つかったには見つかったが……すまないが、もう一度太陽の神殿の状況を説明してくれるか？","source_cn":"不过，虽然找到了，唉……麻烦两位再介绍一下日神殿的情况吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x066B4A9AC4F6E2B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_